// # Unified Autonomous Drones & UAV Flight Control Facade
//
// Logline: Master facade re-exporting all 49 submodules across UAV dynamics, geometric control, trajectory planning, sensor fusion, navigation, and swarms.
//
// Setup: Pure module shim and unified API providing single-import access to the complete openOODA UAV Flight stack.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import 49 modular kinematics, dynamics, trajectory generation, nonlinear control, estimation, navigation, and swarm submodules.
//   2. Re-export public flight configurations, factory constructors, and controller shims.
//   3. Maintain full backwards compatibility and uniform type access for openOODA autonomous drone applications.
//   4. Expose high-level mission coordinator and unified flight executive factory.

